  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 - Parity with the 1.1 target completed: annotation authoring with drawn appearances, form creation, filling, reset and flatten through the edit plan, text measurement and word wrap, JPEG/BMP/GIF images and ICC profiles, overlays and underlays, bookmarks, page labels, viewer preferences and XMP in an edited document, incremental updates that keep an existing signature, and pixels for images a caller wants to read. Adds fill-form, watermark and sign-and-archive examples. Both legs (net10.0, net11.0) ship in one package. Details: https://github.com/MPCoreDeveloper/SharpCorePDF/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
